  "$comment": "NORMATIVE (DECISIONS.md §0.4). OSV ecosystem casing is authoritative everywhere on the OSV side; deps.dev system strings are lowercase. Raw string comparison on ecosystem/system is FORBIDDEN — resolve through this map. scoring_tier is ecosystem-keyed per DECISIONS.md §5(c).",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
